{"parentUuid":"4bcf93b8-62cd-4a8d-8a7f-c31f9aef43c4","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01VSLUh8YNBoH9v5wS5kQ8gG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The background task completed. I already know it contains 784KB of marker data (I tried to read it earlier). The important finding is that CloudFront needs to be configured to forward query parameters to the origin.\n\nLet me wait for the user to check the CloudFront behavior settings.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72517,"cache_read_input_tokens":28368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72517},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKXu7zXfasUFTCL5TF4K","type":"assistant","uuid":"edbbbdf2-366d-4001-ae61-98a067d3698e","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:10:15.387Z"}
{"parentUuid":"edbbbdf2-366d-4001-ae61-98a067d3698e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01VSLUh8YNBoH9v5wS5kQ8gG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The background task confirmed it - direct server access returns full data.\n\n**The fix is simple:** CloudFront isn't forwarding the query parameters (`minLat`, `maxLat`, `minLon`, `maxLon`, `zoom`) to your origin server.\n\nPlease update CloudFront settings:\n\n**CloudFront Console → Distributions → E12FYIQ8RRXOJ1 → Behaviors tab:**\n\n1. Select the default `*` behavior\n2. Click **\"Edit\"**  \n3. Find **\"Cache key and origin requests\"** section:\n   - **Origin request policy:** Select **\"AllViewer\"**\n   \n   (This makes CloudFront forward ALL query parameters, headers, and cookies to your origin)\n\n4. **Save changes**\n5. **Wait 2-3 minutes** for deployment\n\nThen test again - the map should show data!\n\nLet me know when you've made this change."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":72517,"cache_read_input_tokens":28368,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":72517},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKXu7zXfasUFTCL5TF4K","type":"assistant","uuid":"cb7839ee-bcca-4060-be77-9ef6e478ef8c","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:10:20.759Z"}
