{"parentUuid":"97dce1c6-bb25-48a1-8608-1fe123cf96f5","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"What about Path Pattern?"}]},"uuid":"fe7d6117-def0-41e0-a057-de1eb256e1aa","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:19:24.073Z","todos":[],"permissionMode":"acceptEdits"}
{"parentUuid":"fe7d6117-def0-41e0-a057-de1eb256e1aa","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01LmxPNBRLRPtTscgymCtuvQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is on the \"Create behavior\" screen, not editing the existing default behavior. They're asking about the Path Pattern.For the map to work, they don't need to create a new behavior - they need to edit the existing default behavior. But since they're already on the create screen, let me explain:\n\n- Path pattern: This determines which URLs this behavior applies to\n- For a new behavior, they would need to specify which paths (like `/get_markers`, `/stream_markers`, etc.)\n- But actually, the easier approach is to edit the DEFAULT behavior (path pattern `*`) to forward all query parameters\n\nLet me tell them to cancel this and instead edit the default behavior.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":818,"cache_read_input_tokens":100885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":818},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYcfncUHQfxSiBDn18G","type":"assistant","uuid":"99c8e168-8ec1-42eb-815b-47abfbab084a","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:19:36.983Z"}
{"parentUuid":"99c8e168-8ec1-42eb-815b-47abfbab084a","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01LmxPNBRLRPtTscgymCtuvQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Cancel this!** You don't need to create a new behavior. \n\nInstead, you need to **EDIT the existing DEFAULT behavior**:\n\n1. **Cancel** this \"Create behavior\" screen\n2. Go back to the **Behaviors tab**\n3. You should see a behavior with **Path pattern: `Default (*)`**\n4. **Select that row** (check the box)\n5. Click **\"Edit\"** button\n6. Scroll down to find **\"Cache key and origin requests\"**\n7. Change **\"Origin request policy\"** to **\"AllViewer\"**\n8. Save\n\nThe default `*` behavior applies to all paths, so editing it will make CloudFront forward query parameters for all requests (including `/get_markers`).\n\nDon't create a new behavior - just edit the existing default one!"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":818,"cache_read_input_tokens":100885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":818},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYcfncUHQfxSiBDn18G","type":"assistant","uuid":"60d49694-3a9f-4b18-adb7-c8cf3bd16eab","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:19:40.979Z"}
