{"parentUuid":"826ab18d-1c4f-4603-ba18-e2c297a4e39b","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"Screen"}]},"uuid":"788b1935-e2b8-4eb9-992f-a27385f4bcc9","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:23:49.623Z","todos":[],"permissionMode":"acceptEdits"}
{"parentUuid":"788b1935-e2b8-4eb9-992f-a27385f4bcc9","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01Ebqs4Q8dU4z75zuU681MhX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! I can see the Behaviors tab with one behavior:- Path pattern: `Default (*)`\n- Origin: `simplemap.safecast...`\n- Viewer protocol policy: `Redirect HTTP to HT...`\n- Cache policy name: `Managed-CachingOptimiz` (looks like CachingOptimized)\n- Origin request policy: `Managed-AllViewer`\n\nWait! The Origin request policy is already set to `Managed-AllViewer`! This is exactly what I told them to set. So CloudFront should already be forwarding all query parameters, headers, and cookies to the origin.\n\nIf the Origin request policy is already \"AllViewer\" and the origin server responds correctly when tested directly, then why is CloudFront returning `null`?\n\nLet me think about this:\n1. Origin request policy: AllViewer ✅ (forwarding all params)\n2. Server responds correctly when tested directly ✅\n3. CloudFront returns `null` ❌\n\nThis could mean:\n1. Cache is returning stale/wrong data - need to invalidate cache\n2. There's a different issue with the CloudFront configurationLet me ask them to invalidate the CloudFront cache to clear any cached `null` responses.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":979,"cache_read_input_tokens":101703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":979},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYxDuRwiMAwUFQMhhD1","type":"assistant","uuid":"c6bf5382-43c4-40db-b470-b3ccb67dc751","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:24:05.632Z"}
{"parentUuid":"c6bf5382-43c4-40db-b470-b3ccb67dc751","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01Ebqs4Q8dU4z75zuU681MhX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Wait!** I can see your Origin request policy is already set to **\"Managed-AllViewer\"** - that's correct! ✅\n\nSo the settings are right, but CloudFront might have **cached the `null` responses** from earlier.\n\n**We need to invalidate the cache:**\n\n1. Stay in CloudFront console\n2. Click on **\"Invalidations\"** tab\n3. Click **\"Create invalidation\"**\n4. Object paths: Enter `/*` (this clears everything)\n5. Click **\"Create invalidation\"**\n6. Wait 1-2 minutes\n\nThis will clear all cached responses and force CloudFront to fetch fresh data from your origin.\n\nAfter the invalidation completes, test the map again - it should now show data!\n\nTry it and let me know!"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":979,"cache_read_input_tokens":101703,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":979},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYxDuRwiMAwUFQMhhD1","type":"assistant","uuid":"b16796e7-9087-4248-a5e8-961f868c3c7d","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:24:09.641Z"}
