{"parentUuid":"0876dba6-3686-4efd-8566-9db81d3d8ca8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01175xJEKYSdAoWgxN5DPVdA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! Now let me provide a summary and ask about the performance improvement.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":103172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":352},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYzmU36Cc2jvwGd4fht","type":"assistant","uuid":"c64b8bd7-349d-4314-8688-d36eb944f1c5","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:24:34.652Z"}
{"parentUuid":"c64b8bd7-349d-4314-8688-d36eb944f1c5","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01175xJEKYSdAoWgxN5DPVdA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 🎊 Success! Here's what we fixed today:\n\n### 1. **Database Performance** ✅\n- Ran `VACUUM ANALYZE` on 123.5 million row `markers` table\n- Fixed catastrophically outdated statistics (thought it had 182k rows!)\n- Query planner now makes correct decisions\n\n### 2. **Network Performance** ✅  \n- Set up AWS CloudFront CDN\n- Traffic now routes through **Tokyo (NRT12-P9)** edge location\n- Bypassed the 60% packet loss to Germany issue\n\n### 3. **CloudFront Configuration** ✅\n- Created `origin-simplemap.safecast.org` DNS record\n- Configured CloudFront with proper origin settings\n- Origin request policy: AllViewer (forwards all query params)\n- Invalidated cache to clear stale responses\n\n## **How does it feel now from Japan?**\n\n- **Page load speed?**\n- **Map responsiveness?** \n- **Compared to before CloudFront?**\n\nYou should notice a **huge improvement** - especially with the Tokyo edge location serving cached content!\n\n---\n\n**Important for future deployments:**\n\nWhen you deploy new code, remember to invalidate CloudFront cache:\n```bash\naws cloudfront create-invalidation --distribution-id E12FYIQ8RRXOJ1 --paths \"/*\"\n```\n\nOr via AWS Console: CloudFront → Distributions → Invalidations → Create invalidation\n\nCongratulations! 🚀"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":352,"cache_read_input_tokens":103172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":352},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKYzmU36Cc2jvwGd4fht","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7f9958b-deb4-41e6-ae76-6378c58bbb37","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:24:44.535Z"}
