{"parentUuid":"951ef3fa-e01d-48dc-9214-215f08294b9d","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"And much faster!!!"}]},"uuid":"b9aa56b0-5ff9-4ac2-babb-20b16caab1b9","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:25:10.204Z","todos":[],"permissionMode":"acceptEdits"}
{"parentUuid":"b9aa56b0-5ff9-4ac2-babb-20b16caab1b9","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01Epd2eSaQAQowZZQcbsm1oM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Excellent! The user confirms it's much faster now. This is great - we've successfully solved both the database performance issue and the network latency/packet loss issue by setting up CloudFront.\n\nLet me provide a final summary and some recommendations for monitoring and maintenance.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":103524,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":388},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKZ4ALnTw8a9b8Qrc8fk","type":"assistant","uuid":"e2a30275-f214-4c49-8526-b6698e92b9ef","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:25:20.198Z"}
{"parentUuid":"e2a30275-f214-4c49-8526-b6698e92b9ef","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01Epd2eSaQAQowZZQcbsm1oM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🎉 **Fantastic!** Much faster performance confirmed!\n\n## Summary of Speed Improvements:\n\n**Before:**\n- ❌ 512ms latency to Germany\n- ❌ 60% packet loss\n- ❌ Database with wrong statistics causing slow queries\n- ❌ Direct connection: Japan → Germany every time\n\n**After:**\n- ✅ ~50-100ms latency to Tokyo CloudFront edge\n- ✅ No packet loss (routing through AWS backbone)\n- ✅ Database optimized with correct statistics\n- ✅ Cached content served from Tokyo\n- ✅ Only cache misses go to Germany\n\n## Quick Reference for Future:\n\n**When deploying new code:**\n```bash\n# 1. Build\ngo build -o safecast-new-map .\n\n# 2. Deploy to production\nssh root@65.108.24.131 \"systemctl stop safecast-new-map\"\nrsync -avP ./safecast-new-map root@65.108.24.131:/usr/local/bin/\nssh root@65.108.24.131 \"systemctl start safecast-new-map\"\n\n# 3. Invalidate CloudFront cache\naws cloudfront create-invalidation --distribution-id E12FYIQ8RRXOJ1 --paths \"/*\"\n```\n\n**Monitor performance:**\n- CloudFront metrics: https://console.aws.amazon.com/cloudfront/\n- Check cache hit ratio (should be >70% for good performance)\n\n**Database maintenance:**\n- Run `VACUUM ANALYZE markers;` monthly to keep statistics fresh\n\nEnjoy the fast map! 🚀🗾"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":388,"cache_read_input_tokens":103524,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":388},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKZ4ALnTw8a9b8Qrc8fk","type":"assistant","uuid":"1256ede5-6e1b-4376-bc92-2f2642808ab6","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:25:28.024Z"}
