{"parentUuid":"717c7921-d47a-4c9e-b989-2bbfd9c447c6","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"rob@rob-GS66-Stealth-10UG:~/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map$ ping simplemap.safec\nast.org\nPING simplemap.safecast.org (3.173.254.100) 56(84) bytes of data.\n64 bytes from server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net (3.173.254.100): icmp_seq=1 ttl=247 time=39.7 ms\n64 bytes from server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net (3.173.254.100): icmp_seq=2 ttl=247 time=33.7 ms\n64 bytes from server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net (3.173.254.100): icmp_seq=3 ttl=247 time=34.1 ms\n64 bytes from server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net (3.173.254.100): icmp_seq=4 ttl=247 time=41.2 ms"}]},"uuid":"40273037-a906-474c-aad1-94c08f77fe15","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:25:59.095Z","todos":[],"permissionMode":"acceptEdits"}
{"parentUuid":"40273037-a906-474c-aad1-94c08f77fe15","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01AUSr7oC1Yqeyy4H1gWCdt1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The ping results show the dramatic improvement:\n\n**Before (to Germany):**\n- 512ms average latency\n- 60% packet loss\n- Pinging 65.108.24.131 (Hetzner Germany)\n\n**After (to Tokyo CloudFront):**\n- ~37ms average latency (33.7-41.2ms range)\n- 0% packet loss\n- Pinging 3.173.254.100 (server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net - Tokyo)\n\nThat's a **93% reduction in latency** (512ms → 37ms) and **elimination of packet loss** (60% → 0%)!\n\nThis is a massive improvement. The NRT12 in the hostname confirms it's the Tokyo CloudFront edge location.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":103912,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":754},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKZ7ksm22rvixT7Xxpe6","type":"assistant","uuid":"64a6dddc-6f9c-4e41-92d3-40805c442c34","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:26:11.143Z"}
{"parentUuid":"64a6dddc-6f9c-4e41-92d3-40805c442c34","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/home/rob/Documents/Safecast/safecast-new-map","sessionId":"8bf95c26-d9d3-4f78-990c-9784125b69b8","version":"2.1.42","gitBranch":"main","slug":"twinkly-cuddling-yao","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_01AUSr7oC1Yqeyy4H1gWCdt1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**WOW! Look at that improvement!** 🎯\n\n## Performance Comparison:\n\n### Before (Direct to Germany):\n```\nPing: 512ms average\nPacket loss: 60%\nTarget: 65.108.24.131 (Hetzner Germany)\n```\n\n### After (CloudFront Tokyo):\n```\nPing: ~37ms average (33.7-41.2ms)\nPacket loss: 0%\nTarget: server-3-173-254-100.nrt12.r.cloudfront.net (Tokyo)\n```\n\n## **93% latency reduction!** 📉\n- From **512ms** → **37ms**\n- **13.8x faster!**\n- Plus eliminated 60% packet loss\n\nThe `nrt12.r.cloudfront.net` confirms you're hitting the **Tokyo edge location** - exactly what we wanted!\n\nThis is a textbook example of how CDNs dramatically improve international performance. Your Japanese users will have a **much better experience** now! 🇯🇵🚀\n\nGreat work getting this set up! The map should feel snappy and responsive now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":754,"cache_read_input_tokens":103912,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":754},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CYKZ7ksm22rvixT7Xxpe6","type":"assistant","uuid":"170f4fcb-8cee-46a8-8889-6c48369233b4","timestamp":"2026-02-20T15:26:16.416Z"}
